obj_id: agentGenerated_MonthlySalesKPIByRegion-b58191ec
liveboard:
  name: agentGenerated_Monthly Sales KPI By Region
  visualizations:
  - id: Viz_1
    viz_guid: 565bfb0a-71c0-4fc0-955e-e3f114213a39
    note_tile:
      html_parsed_string: |-
        Key Drivers:
        • November and December consistently show highest sales across all years (November 2024: $118,447)
        • Strong seasonal pattern with holiday shopping driving Q4 performance
        • December sales averaged $83,900 across the 4-year period
        • September 2021 peaked at $81,777 showing back-to-school demand

        Recommendations:
        • Increase inventory and marketing spend in Q4 to capitalize on seasonal trends
        • Replicate November strategies in other months to boost year-round performance
